                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Its a charming old game with lots of flaws and great ideas.\nLike I like money system in this game where you buy certain items but its stupidly dull and easy to abuse.\nIts a game worth playing for its story, dialogue and humor.\n\nIts major flaw is stupid horse mechanic. You travel from area to area cost you energy on the horse and you need to grind for carrots if you dont have money or you stuck on farm or you need to search for magical spawning 1 dollar bills inside drawers.  Like what developer thought its a good idea to be any sort of game from this genre? It doesn't add anything its just a stupid and annoying grind that you need to do. \nGladly it takes like 5 minutes to grow bunch of carrots but still its so dumb.",
